  "text": "Ésa is named in versions of the Tochmarc Étaíne and the Togail Bruidne Da Derga that fall outside the most widely known text. In those tellings she is a daughter of Eochaid Airem and Étaín. From her line comes Mes Buachalla, the foundling who becomes the mother of Conaire Mór. The spelling Ésa also appears as Esa, Ess, or Es across manuscripts.",
